.SH "v3\&.3\&.1 - 2024-01-22"
.PP
Kudos to @kossnocorp and @fturmel for working on the release\&.
.SS "Fixed"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixed DST issue in \fRgetOverlappingDaysInIntervals\fP, resulting in an inconsistent number of days returned for intervals starting and ending in different DST periods\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixed functions incorrectly using \fRtrunc\fP instead of \fRround\fP\&. The bug was introduced in v3\&.3\&.0\&. The affected functions: \fRdifferenceInCalendarDays\fP, \fRdifferenceInCalendarISOWeeks\fP, \fRdifferenceInCalendarWeeks\fP, \fRgetISOWeek\fP, \fRgetWeek\fP, and \fRgetISOWeeksInYear\fP\&.
.PP
.SH "v3\&.3\&.0 - 2024-01-20"
.PP
On this release worked @kossnocorp, @TheKvikk, @fturmel and @ckcherry23\&.
.SS "Fixed"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixed the bug in \fRgetOverlappingDaysInIntervals\fP caused by incorrect sorting of interval components that led to 0 for timestamps of different lengths\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixed bugs when working with negative numbers caused by using \fRMath\&.floor\fP (\fR-1\&.1\fP → \fR-2\fP) instead of \fRMath\&.trunc\fP (\fR-1\&.1\fP → \fR-1\fP)\&. Most of the conversion functions (i\&.e\&., \fRhoursToMinutes\fP) were affected when passing some negative fractional input\&. Also, some other functions that could be possibly affected by unfortunate timezone/date combinations were fixed\&.

.PP
The functions that were affected: \fRformat\fP, \fRparse\fP, \fRgetUnixTime\fP, \fRdaysToWeeks\fP, \fRhoursToMilliseconds\fP, \fRhoursToMinutes\fP, \fRhoursToSeconds\fP, \fRmilliseconds\fP, \fRminutesToMilliseconds\fP, \fRmillisecondsToMinutes\fP, \fRmonthsToYears\fP, \fRmillisecondsToHours\fP, \fRmillisecondsToSeconds\fP, \fRminutesToHours\fP, \fRminutesToSeconds\fP, \fRyearsToQuarters\fP, \fRyearsToMonths\fP, \fRyearsToDays\fP, \fRweeksToDays\fP, \fRsecondsToMinutes\fP, \fRsecondsToHours\fP, \fRquartersToYears\fP, \fRquartersToMonths\fP and \fRmonthsToQuarters\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRFixed the Czech locale's \fRformatDistance\fP to include \fR1\fP in \fRformatDistance\fP\&.\fP
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixed \fRdifferenceInSeconds\fP and other functions relying on rounding options that can produce a negative 0\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRAdded a preprocessor to the locales API, enabling fixing a long-standing bug in the French locale\&.\fP (\fR#1391\fP)
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added missing \fRyearsToDays\fP to the FP submodule\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Made functions using rounding methods always return \fR0\fP instead of \fR-0\fP\&.
.PP
.SS "Added"
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRAdded \fRformat\fP alias \fRformatDate\fP with corresponding \fRFormatDateOptions\fP interface\fP\&.
.PP
