.IP "\(bu" 2
Prevent \fRstartOf\&.\&.\&.\fP, \fRendOf\&.\&.\&.\fP and \fRlastDayOf\&.\&.\&.\fP functions to return dates with an incorrect time when the date is modifying into another time zone\&.
