.IP "\(bu" 2
Fix a bug in \fRgetISOWeek\fP appearing because of a changing time zone (e\&.g\&., when the given date is in DST and the start of the ISO year is not)\&.
.PP
.SS "Changed"
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBBREAKING\fP: all functions are moved to the root of the library, so they are now accessible with \fRrequire('date-fns/name_of_function')\fP or \fRimport nameOfFunction from 'date-fns/name_of_function'\fP\&.

.PP
.PP
.nf
// Before v1\&.0\&.0
var addMonths = require("date\-fns/src/add_months");

// v1\&.0\&.0 onward
var addMonths = require("date\-fns/add_months");
.fi
.PP

.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBBREAKING\fP: functions that had the last optional argument \fRweekStartsAt\fP (i\&.e\&. \fRendOfWeek\fP, \fRisSameWeek\fP, \fRlastDayOfWeek\fP, \fRsetDay\fP, \fRstartOfWeek\fP) now instead receive the object \fRoptions\fP with the property \fRoptions\&.weekStartsOn\fP as the last argument\&.

.PP
.PP
.nf
// Before v1\&.0\&.0
var result = endOfWeek(new Date(2014, 8, 2), 1);

// v1\&.0\&.0 onward
var result = endOfWeek(new Date(2014, 8, 2), { weekStartsOn: 1 });
.fi
.PP

.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBBREAKING\fP: remove the function \fRgetTimeSinceMidnight\fP that was used inside the other functions\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBBREAKING\fP: \fRdifferenceInDays\fP now returns the number of full days instead of calendar days\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fBBREAKING\fP: \fReachDay\fP and \fRisWithinRange\fP now throw an exception when the given range boundaries are invalid\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Faster \fRisLeapYear\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fIInternal\fP: make the documentation more verbose\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fIInternal\fP: convert the tests from Chai to power-assert allowing them to run against IE8\&.
